<title>JAPAN: Janome to liquidate real estate unit.</title>
<headline>Janome to liquidate real estate unit.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Janome Sewing Machine Co Ltd said on Monday it would liquidate its wholly-owned real estate subsidiary before the end of March and incur a loss of about four billion yen in the process.</p>
<p>Janome said in a statement that it would sell some of its assets to offset the loss and did not revise its parent earnings forecast for the current business year.</p>
<p>The company said the subsidiary, which was managing its real estate holdings, was no longer necessary as Janome planned to sell part of its real estate holdings to strengthen its financial position.</p>
</text>
